      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "\n## Pony Diffusion V6 XL - text to image\n\nSDXL finetune for high quality anime/cartoon/illustration images.\n\n- **CLIP skip -2** is required by the model, otherwise output is blurry.\n- Prompt template (built into the positive node):\n  `score_9, score_8_up, score_7_up, score_6_up, score_5_up, score_4_up, <description>`\n- Recommended: Euler a, 25 steps, 1024px. A negative prompt is usually\n  unnecessary.\n- Optional 4x upscale: `generate_image.py --upscale` (4x-UltraSharp); the\n  upsample nodes below are bypassed unless enabled.\n- Optional source tags: `source_pony`, `source_furry`, `source_cartoon`,\n  `source_anime`. Content ratings: `rating_safe`, `rating_questionable`,\n  `rating_explicit`.\n\n**models**\n\n- [ponyDiffusionV6XL_v6StartWithThisOne.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/LyliaEngine/Pony_Diffusion_V6_XL/resolve/main/ponyDiffusionV6XL_v6StartWithThisOne.safetensors)\n- [4x-UltraSharp.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Kim2091/UltraSharp/resolve/main/4x-UltraSharp.safetensors) (optional upscaler)\n\nModel Storage Location\n\n```\nComfyUI/\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 models/\n    \u251c\u2500\u2500 checkpoints/\n    \u2502      \u2514\u2500\u2500 ponyDiffusionV6XL_v6StartWithThisOne.safetensors\n    \u2514\u2500\u2500 upscale_models/\n           \u2514\u2500\u2500 4x-UltraSharp.safetensors\n```\n\nDriven by `generate_image.py --workflow default_imagegen` (see AGENTS.md).\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "\n## Pony Diffusion V6 XL - text to image\n\nSDXL finetune for high quality anime/cartoon/illustration images.\n\n- **CLIP skip -2** is required by the model, otherwise output is blurry.\n- Prompt template (built into the positive node):\n  `score_9, score_8_up, score_7_up, score_6_up, score_5_up, score_4_up, <description>`\n- Recommended: Euler a, 25 steps, 1024px. A negative prompt is usually\n  unnecessary.\n- Optional 4x upscale: `generate_image.py --upscale` (4x-UltraSharp); the\n  upsample nodes below are bypassed unless enabled.\n- Optional source tags: `source_pony`, `source_furry`, `source_cartoon`,\n  `source_anime`. Content ratings: `rating_safe`, `rating_questionable`,\n  `rating_explicit`.\n\n**models**\n\n- [ponyDiffusionV6XL_v6StartWithThisOne.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/LyliaEngine/Pony_Diffusion_V6_XL/resolve/main/ponyDiffusionV6XL_v6StartWithThisOne.safetensors)\n- [4x-UltraSharp.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Kim2091/UltraSharp/resolve/main/4x-UltraSharp.safetensors) (optional upscaler)\n\nModel Storage Location\n\n```\nComfyUI/\n\u2514\u2500\u2500 models/\n    \u251c\u2500\u2500 checkpoints/\n    \u2502      \u2514\u2500\u2500 ponyDiffusionV6XL_v6StartWithThisOne.safetensors\n    \u2514\u2500\u2500 upscale_models/\n           \u2514\u2500\u2500 4x-UltraSharp.safetensors\n```\n\nDriven by `generate_image.py --workflow default_imagegen` (see AGENTS.md).\n"
      },
